<title>CHILE: Koreans looking at wide range of Chile investments.</title>
<headline>Koreans looking at wide range of Chile investments.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean businessmen are considering investments at every stage of producing copper in Chile, from mining to refining, Chilean Energy Minister Benjamin Teplizky said.</p>
<p>Teplizky said an agreement between industrial group Hyundai and Chile's National Mining Society to study building a smelter in Chile was potentially only one investment that the Koreans might be interested in.</p>
</text>
